{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a72098d1ceb6e9ee","name":"Weapon Mount","source":{"id":"source:reference-a72098d1ceb6e9ee","title":"Weapon Mount","revision":19807,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:38:20Z","sha256":"0b517e8d572b77b397255e83721666e4ab548f2ac525014d1af1582576453d9b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19807","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Weapon%20Mount&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a72098d1ceb6e9ee","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEAPON MOUNT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["UPGRADE POINT"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/UPGRADE_POINT"}," COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["AVAILABILITY\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Standard\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Concealed\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["3,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Armors can add any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Integrated Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Integrated_Equipment","referenceId":"reference:3f482f55a9a8aa19"}," Upgrade, but dedicated Weapon Mounts allow Weapons to be added more efficiently. The number of Weapon Mounts gained for each Upgrade Slot spent is proportional to the type of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," Upgraded; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"}," gains 2 Weapon Mounts, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medium Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medium_Armor","referenceId":"reference:e2a45d7d144d40dd"}," gains 3 Weapon Mounts, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"}," gains 4 Weapon Mounts.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Two-Handed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Two-Handed"}," weapon requires 2 Weapon Mounts, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["One-Handed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/One-Handed"}," weapon requires 1 Weapon Mount, and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Weapon"}," requires only half of a Weapon Mount. You must be proficient with both the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," on which it is mounted to be considered proficient with a Mounted Weapon. (Any weapon described as gloves or gauntlets, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Combat Gloves"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combat_Gloves","referenceId":"reference:2bd4897a780f381e"},", can be worn with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," without a Weapon Mount, but only one such weapon can be worn at a time.)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This Upgrade does not include the cost of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapons"}," to be mounted. Such weapons are designed only for mount use, and can't be fired as hand-held weapons. It takes 10 minutes and a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check to change weapons in a Weapon Mount. A Mounted Weapon cannot be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarmed"},", and it need not be drawn to be used. Weapons in mounts are obvious unless the Weapon Mount is Concealed, in which case it takes a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check to notice the Weapon when not in use. A Mounted Weapon does not gain any benefit from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," if the weapon takes damage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autonomous"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autonomous?action=edit&redlink=1"}," weapon is mounted to a suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},", it is automatically considered seated (and thus can make attacks while the Armor's wearer takes other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"},"). However, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autonomous"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autonomous?action=edit&redlink=1"}," weapons can distract and unbalance the wearer due to their recoil, though heavier armors are better at absorbing this shock. For every ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autonomous"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autonomous?action=edit&redlink=1"}," Mounted Weapon that has made an attack within the last round (that is, since the wearer's last turn), the wearer must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to regain balance; furthermore, the wearer takes a penalty on all attack rolls and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},"- or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},"-based skill checks determined by the class of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," worn: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"}," -10, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medium Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medium_Armor","referenceId":"reference:e2a45d7d144d40dd"}," -5, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"}," -2.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
